<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Duta Pertiwi declares dividend.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Duta Pertiwi declares dividend.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian property firm PT Duta Pertiwi said on Wednesday it would pay a dividend of 20 rupiah per share for 1996.</p>
<p>The company, part of the Sinar Mas group, in April announced a net profit of 96.11 billion rupiah compared with 92.15 billion rupiah in the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
